       en="The **privative prefix α-/αν-** (un-, in-) negates adjectives: *άπειρος* (without limit, infinite; from *πέρας*, end), *αδύνατος* (impossible), *ασύμμετρος* (incommensurable), *άρρητος* (inexpressible). The opposite of *άπειρος* in maths is **πεπερασμένος** (finite, “having reached its end”), a perfect participle of the old verb *περαίνω*.",
